# Official mainnet Electrum wss:// endpoints (comma-separated).
# Same model as cykuza-web NEXT_PUBLIC_ELECTRUMX_MAINNET: inject at build time,
# never commit real hosts. Prefer ≥2 URLs so dual-server verify can engage.
# Leave empty for source/CI builds (custom wss:// only). See docs/self-host-electrum.md.
# Example placeholders (not real servers):
# CYKUZA_ELECTRUM_MAINNET_URLS=wss://electrum-mainnet-1.example:50004,wss://electrum-mainnet-2.example:50004
CYKUZA_ELECTRUM_MAINNET_URLS=
